Package: HBSCM
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Synthetic Control with Horseshoe Priors
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Xiaohua", "Ma", email = "mxh051218@163.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits the panel interactive effects model of Ma et al. (2026)
    <doi:10.1016/j.econmod.2026.107502> using horseshoe shrinkage.
    Includes a grouped extension, an adaptive lasso comparator, a staggered
    adoption simulator and posterior predictive treatment effect summaries.
