Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: pblasso (== 1.0.8), ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0), Rcpp, rlang, stats
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
SystemRequirements: C++17
